{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e257d6006945d28022e3","chatId":"afc7a80ebf55445684f70e741f2b66c0","sessionId":null,"userId":59010,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[D]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[D]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":724,"promptTokens":1536,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:34:47"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003592917602535283,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e257d6006945d28022e2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368087327,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:34:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e257d6006945d28022e2","chatId":"afc7a80ebf55445684f70e741f2b66c0","sessionId":null,"userId":59010,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n琪琪、俊俊和涵涵都是他们社区的活动小组成员。他们正在策划一项新的社区服务项目。涵涵是新加入的成员，他对社区服务还不太了解。一天，俊俊发现琪琪正在拿着一份他们正在规划的社区服务项目的详细计划，琪琪向俊俊抬了抬眉，并轻摇了手中的计划书，然后转向看向涵涵，仿佛在示意些什么。琪琪迅速看了一眼俊俊，然后带着微笑把文件递给了涵涵。涵涵爽快地接过了计划书，开始读了起来。\n\n[问题]\n琪琪为什么会把文件给涵涵？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 琪琪需要涵涵帮忙修改计划书。\nB. 琪琪想让涵涵充当负责人的角色。\nC. 琪琪想让涵涵进入工作状态。\nD. 琪琪希望涵涵能增加他在规划中的投入。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003592917602535283,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e257d6006945d28022e3","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368087324,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:34:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"e72e5691b10a4647b6bb784cea4c64e3"}